# JSON under scraper/ is product data the pipeline reads at runtime (the
# town/county cross-reference, county centroids, the USGS distance table) —
# losing it to an ignore rule breaks a rebuild the same way a missing
# requirements.txt entry does. See AGENTS.md "All code updates ... commit".
!scraper/*.json
